<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIAN CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 14/15.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIAN CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR MAY 14/15.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Thursday, May 15 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   15.05.97	  14.05.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5304	    6.4772</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3467	    2.3511</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5746	    4.5726</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.3619	    3.3543</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5211	    0.5197</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7790	    0.7788</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2933	    0.2937</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.9729	    6.9711</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6948	    0.6949</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2687	    1.2697</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
